sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant S as Electronic Market
    participant I as Glue inbox
    participant G as Glue worker and router
    participant WH as Bucharest warehouse
    participant E as eMAG

    C->>S: Buy now
    S->>I: POST /events order.placed, event id, HMAC of id and body
    I->>I: verify, validate, insert if (source, event id) is new
    I-->>S: 202 Accepted
    G->>I: claim pending events
    G->>G: take the order's lock, insert shop-1001 if new, status received
    G->>WH: POST /orders, Idempotency-Key shop-1001
    WH-->>G: 503, Retry-After 2
    Note over G: retry_scheduled, wait 2 s (Retry-After is capped at 30 s)
    G->>WH: POST /orders, Idempotency-Key shop-1001
    alt 201 reserved
        WH-->>G: 201
        G->>G: status allocated, order_allocated
        G->>WH: GET /stock
        G->>S: new stock for the product
        G->>E: product_offer/save with the new stock
    else 409 insufficient stock
        WH-->>G: 409
        G->>G: status failed, review item: sold out
    else still failing after 5 attempts
        G->>G: status failed, review item: warehouse outage
    end
    G->>I: mark event done
